# Sympl Test Cases

This file contains test cases for the Sympl cryptographic algorithm implementation.

## Test Categories

1. Mathematical Operations
   - Factorial computation
   - Fibonacci sequence generation
   - Modular exponentiation

2. Cryptographic Operations
   - RSA key generation
   - Encryption/decryption
   - Hash function

## Running Tests

Execute the Sympl tool with the test_sympl.sympl file to run all test cases.

## Expected Results

All tests should pass with correct mathematical and cryptographic operations.

## Notes

These are symbolic tests for demonstration purposes.
Actual cryptographic testing requires standard test vectors.
